::  name       aurora signature length
::  shape      length - int (@u32)
::  invariant  an Ed25519 attestation is exactly 64 bytes (signature_length)
::  example    64
::  readers    Aurora · Kumara · Glow Tend · Sur museum · Ashvini nest-only
::  nib        equinox-e208-aurora-tend-v0
::
::  Equinox e208 · Aurora A4 — fourth Aurora structure pedestal in src/sur/.
::  Names signature_length from aurora/src/kumara.rye (Ed25519 encoded
::  length). Pedestal only; bare-metal boot stays in aurora/src.
+$  aurora-signature-length-shape
